BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LSP: How to Apply for Canadian Citizenship
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T120000
UID:6a1e1900bd892a0672e71371@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Do you understand the process of Canadian citizenship?\nIf you
  are planning to become a Canadian citizen\, you're welcome to attend thi
 s seminar. This seminar will help you understand the citizenship applicat
 ion process\, the documents you need to prepare\, and important things to
  keep in mind.\nThe workshop will be in English and Mandarin.\nIn partners
 hip with Immigration\, Refugees and Citizenship Canada\, CultureLink\nSett
 lement & Community Services & Toronto Public Library.
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a1e1900bd892a0672e71371
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
