DESCRIPTION:Presented by\nRiverdale Immigrant Women’s Centre\n\, this wo
 rkshop will provide details to help better understand credit scores\, resp
 onsible borrowing\, and effective ways to reduce and manage debt.\nDrop-In
LOCATION:Deer Park\, Room 204 (upstairs)
